& [ConfirmedCommandPlan: P8FixtureMaterial] is the command and verification plan for future implementation slices
  + [baseline_compile_command] is python -m compileall -q src tests
  + [baseline_test_command] is python -m unittest discover -s tests
  + [targeted_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_p8_fixture_material_contracts
  + [targeted_existing_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir8_integrated_manager_contracts
  + [targeted_existing_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir7_operations_dry_run_contracts
  + [diff_hygiene_command] is git diff --check
  + [generated_output_review] is prove generated outputs and reports are ignored, disposable, reproducible, and non-authoritative
  + [no_dispatch_review] is prove fixture success and generated proof results remain evidence, not assignment or dispatch effects
  + [no_live_effect_review] is prove commands, processes, GPU, model runtimes, jobs, credentials, network state, destructive filesystem targets, platform mailboxes, source docs, and expected ledgers are not mutated by fixture proof code or tests

  = must: run baseline tests and diff hygiene after every future slice
  = should: run compile check after code slices begin
  = must: run targeted P8 contract tests once tests.test_p8_fixture_material_contracts exists

